  "vulnerability_information": "Application should not allow the user to set the last 3-5 password in terms of secure design principles. It should give a warning or provide such avoidance while user is using repetitive usage of passwords.\n\nRepro:\n1. Try to set same old password via Password Reset link.\n\nFix: Application should avoid user to set last history of passwords to enforce the security.\n\nLet me know if any further info is required.\n\nRegards,\nMr_R3boot.  ",
